 "titulo": "The bet that trapped the Monkey King 🐒 Part 3 #mythology #shorts",
 "capa": "500 YEARS UNDER A MOUNTAIN",
 "descripcion": "Sun Wukong ate the peaches of immortality and fought all of Heaven, until the Buddha offered him a bet.\n\nFrom Journey to the West, by Wu Cheng'en (16th century), chapters 4-7.\n\nWould you have taken that bet?\n\n#mythology #monkeyking #sunwukong #chinesemythology #shorts",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Heaven gave him a job: keeper of the heavenly horses.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Heaven wanted the rebel monkey close.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He found out it was the lowest post, and stormed off.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He named himself Great Sage, Equal of Heaven.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Later, set to guard the peach garden, he ate the peaches of immortality.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Each peach could make a god live for thousands of years.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then he ate Lord Lao Tzu's magic pills too.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Heaven's armies could not stop him.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "They threw him into a furnace for forty-nine days.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He came out stronger, with eyes of fire.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "So the Buddha made a bet: jump out of my palm.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "If you win, you get Heaven. If not, you go back down.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He laughed. One somersault would do it.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He flew to five pillars at the end of the world, and wrote his name.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then, to mark the spot, he peed on one of them.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He flew back. The Buddha showed him his palm. It smelled of monkey.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The pillars were the Buddha's fingers. The hand became a mountain.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "Five hundred years under it. Would you have made that bet?",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
